flowchart TD
    A[instruction event] --> B{deduped?}
    B -->|seen| C[skip]
    B -->|new| D[screen + monitor]
    D --> E{hit / rule fired?}
    E -->|no| F[done]
    E -->|yes| G[raise alert]
    G --> H{escalate?}
    H -->|yes| I[open case + suspicious:detected → Reporting]
    H -->|no| J[queue for review]
    K[worker crash] --> L[replay stream + idempotency key]
